            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <instructions>Heat oil and add cumin seeds until they splutter. Add onions and green chili, 
sauté until soft. Add mashed potatoes and peas. Season with turmeric, coriander, 
garam masala, and salt. Mix well and cook for 2-3 minutes. Cool before using 
as filling.</instructions>
        <rdfs:label>Samosa Filling</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


