        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <instructions>Soak tamarind in water 30 minutes. Extract tamarind juice. Blend fresh green chili and coriander leaves with water. Mix tamarind juice, blended herbs, chaat masala and salt. Adjust consistency with water. Serve at room temperature.</instructions>
