            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <instructions>Dry roast puffed rice 3-4 minutes until crispy. Cool. In large bowl mix roasted puffed rice, crushed papdi, sev. Add finely chopped onion, tomato, boiled potato cubes, green chili, coriander.</instructions>
